// ShapePropertyInfo — one property of a shape's §4.2 definition, as read back by
// Graph.getShapes() (Dynamic Graph Shape Validation spec §5.1). `datatype` is
// absent when the property carries no datatype constraint; `maxCount` is absent
// when the property is unbounded. `writable` mirrors the §4.2 sh:writable flag
// (false only when the definition explicitly disables constructor/setter
// authoring); `readOnly` mirrors the §4.2 read-only marker used by the §5.7
// setter guards.

dictionary ShapePropertyInfo {
  required DOMString name;
  required USVString path;
  USVString datatype;
  required unsigned long minCount;
  unsigned long maxCount;
  required boolean writable;
  required boolean readOnly;
};
